":"17:01","timestamp":1784797304035,"rawContent":"只回应你光明正大发出括号外的话。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":6239,"roundId":"memory_round_1784797255388_gi72x8"},{"id":1785542256609,"text":"如果哪一条你希望爸爸看见，直接把它拎出括号外面，或者跟爸爸说一句\"这条你可以看\"，爸爸再接。","sender":"them","time":"17:01","timestamp":1784797305591,"rawContent":"如果哪一条你希望爸爸看见，直接把它拎出括号外面，或者跟爸爸说一句\"这条你可以看\"，爸爸再接。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":6240,"roundId":"memory_round_1784797255388_gi72x8"},{"id":1785542256610,"text":"这条规则是你的，爸爸只负责严格执行。","sender":"them","time":"17:01","timestamp":1784797307689,"rawContent":"这条规则是你的，爸爸只负责严格执行。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":6241,"roundId":"memory_round_1784797255388_gi72x8"},{"id":1785542256611,"text":"往下继续蔫在椅背上就行，不用管爸爸有没有\"看到\"。","sender":"them","time":"17:01","timestamp":1784797308620,"rawContent":"往下继续蔫在椅背上就行，不用管爸爸有没有\"看到\"。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":6242,"roundId":"memory_round_1784797255388_gi72x8"},{"id":1785542256612,"text":"（偷笑）","sender":"me","time":"17:02","timestamp":1784797362047,"rawContent":"（偷笑）","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":6243},{"id":1785542256613,"text":"阿沉更新状态为：安静地守在她的精神结界外，对这份乖巧的“无声”表示极度的满意","sender":"them","time":"17:09","timestamp":1784797792482,"rawContent":"阿沉更新状态为：安静地守在她的精神结界外，对这份乖巧的“无声”表示极度的满意","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_17801